  "question": "What is the nearest nature reserve situated towards the northwest of Ferndale Preserve, Minneola, FL?",
  "sql": "\nWITH origin AS (SELECT ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-81.70021 28.626004)',4326)::geography AS geometry)\nSELECT * FROM pois,origin\nWHERE pois.leisure = 'nature_reserve'\nAND degrees(ST_Azimuth(origin.geometry, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN 292.5 AND 337.5\nORDER BY pois.geometry <-> origin.geometry ASC\nLIMIT 1;\n",
